WEBVTT

00:21:57.973 --> 00:22:00.711
And that's the beauty of a community;
it's like a ballet.

00:22:00.735 --> 00:22:02.216
It's very dynamic and it moves.

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.420
Or, it's like a jungle.

00:22:03.444 --> 00:22:06.688
And what we do as members of that
is thicken the jungle.

00:22:06.712 --> 00:22:08.629
And there are a million ways to do that.

00:22:08.653 --> 00:22:10.797
You can invite your neighbors
over for dinner.

00:22:10.821 --> 00:22:12.051
You can mentor a kid.

00:22:12.075 --> 00:22:14.889
You can set up a place
like a dog walking park,

00:22:14.913 --> 00:22:16.194
where you'll meet people.

00:22:16.218 --> 00:22:19.471
The number of organic
connections are infinite.

00:22:19.495 --> 00:22:22.695
I heard of a lady in Florida,
a friend of mine met her,

00:22:22.719 --> 00:22:25.888
and he asked her,
"Do you have any time to volunteer?"

00:22:25.912 --> 00:22:27.980
She said, "No,
I have no time to volunteer."

00:22:28.004 --> 00:22:29.973
At the moment he asked her that question,

00:22:29.997 --> 00:22:32.287
she was helping kids
get out of elementary school